<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Xenogerm Trader Stock -->
  <XTS_SettingsCategory>商人異種細胞庫存</XTS_SettingsCategory>

  <!-- EN: Xenotypes for sale -->
  <XTS_XenotypesSection>出售異種人</XTS_XenotypesSection>
  <!-- EN: Archite xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterArchite>遠古分子異種人</XTS_FilterArchite>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotypes with archite genes, such as sanguophages. Scenario xenotypes are grouped separately. -->
  <XTS_FilterArchiteDesc>含有遠古分子基因的預設異種人，例如噬血者。腳本異種人會另外歸類。</XTS_FilterArchiteDesc>
  <!-- EN: Germline xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterInheritable>種系異種人</XTS_FilterInheritable>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotypes whose genes are passed on to children, such as impids and yttakin. The baseliner xenogerm is listed here too, because it turns a person back into a baseliner. -->
  <XTS_FilterInheritableDesc>基因會遺傳給後代的預設異種人，例如魔人與依達人。一般人類的異種細胞也列在此處，因為它能讓此人變回一般人類。</XTS_FilterInheritableDesc>
  <!-- EN: Scenario xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterPlayerScenario>腳本異種人</XTS_FilterPlayerScenario>
  <!-- EN: The custom xenotypes your starting colonists were created with. Xenotypes you assemble during the game will never be sold. -->
  <XTS_FilterPlayerScenarioDesc>你的開局殖民者所使用的自訂異種人。遊戲中組裝的異種人不會販售。</XTS_FilterPlayerScenarioDesc>
  <!-- EN: No sellable xenotypes are loaded. -->
  <XTS_NoXenotypes>目前沒有載入任何可販售的異種人。</XTS_NoXenotypes>
  <!-- EN: Base xenogerm -->
  <XTS_PriceBase>基礎異種細胞</XTS_PriceBase>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotype -->
  <XTS_PricePreset>預設異種人</XTS_PricePreset>
  <!-- EN: Scenario xenotype -->
  <XTS_PriceScenario>腳本異種人</XTS_PriceScenario>
  <!-- EN: Metabolism {0} × {1} -->
  <XTS_PriceMetabolism>代謝效率 {0} × {1}</XTS_PriceMetabolism>
  <!-- EN: Complexity {0} × {1} -->
  <XTS_PriceComplexity>複雜度 {0} × {1}</XTS_PriceComplexity>
  <!-- EN: Archite genes {0} × {1} -->
  <XTS_PriceArchite>遠古分子基因 {0} × {1}</XTS_PriceArchite>
  <!-- EN: Contains archite genes -->
  <XTS_XenotypeArchite>含有遠古分子基因</XTS_XenotypeArchite>
  <!-- EN: Contains germline genes -->
  <XTS_XenotypeEndogenes>含有種系基因</XTS_XenotypeEndogenes>
  <!-- EN: Contains xenogenes -->
  <XTS_XenotypeXenogenes>含有異種基因</XTS_XenotypeXenogenes>
  <!-- EN: A custom xenotype your starting colonists were created with. -->
  <XTS_CustomXenotypeDesc>你的開局殖民者所使用的自訂異種人。</XTS_CustomXenotypeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Scenario -->
  <XTS_XenotypeSourceScenario>腳本</XTS_XenotypeSourceScenario>

  <!-- EN: Xenogerm pricing -->
  <XTS_PricingSection>異種細胞定價</XTS_PricingSection>
  <!-- EN: The market value of xenogerms sold by traders. -->
  <XTS_PricingSectionDesc>商人所販售異種細胞的市場價值。</XTS_PricingSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Base preset value: {0} -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValue>基礎預設價值：{0}</XTS_BasePresetValue>
  <!-- EN: The silver added to the market value of every xenogerm sold by traders. -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>每個商人販售的異種細胞，市場價值都會增加這麼多白銀。</XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per metabolism: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>每點代謝效率價值：{0}</XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>
  <!-- EN: The silver added for each point of metabolic efficiency, positive or negative. -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>每點代謝效率（無論正負）所增加的白銀。</XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per complexity: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexity>每點複雜度價值：{0}</XTS_ValuePerComplexity>
  <!-- EN: The silver added for each point of complexity. -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>每點複雜度所增加的白銀。</XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per archite gene: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchite>每個遠古分子基因價值：{0}</XTS_ValuePerArchite>
  <!-- EN: The silver added for each archite gene. -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>每個遠古分子基因所增加的白銀。</XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>

  <!-- EN: Stock quantity -->
  <XTS_QuantitySection>庫存數量</XTS_QuantitySection>
  <!-- EN: The number of xenogerms each kind of trader will stock, picked at random from its range. -->
  <XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>每種商人販售的異種細胞數量，從其範圍中隨機選取。</XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: {0}: {1}~{2} -->
  <XTS_TraderCount>{0}：{1}~{2}</XTS_TraderCount>
  <!-- EN: {0} (orbital) -->
  <XTS_TraderOrbital>{0}（軌道）</XTS_TraderOrbital>
  <!-- EN: {0} (caravan) -->
  <XTS_TraderCaravan>{0}（旅隊）</XTS_TraderCaravan>
  <!-- EN: {0} settlements -->
  <XTS_TraderSettlement>{0}據點</XTS_TraderSettlement>
  <!-- EN: The number of xenogerms this trader will arrive with. -->
  <XTS_TraderCountDesc>此商人到訪時攜帶的異種細胞數量。</XTS_TraderCountDesc>
  <!-- EN: The number of xenogerms these settlements will keep in stock. Settlements restock about once a month. -->
  <XTS_SettlementCountDesc>這些據點庫存中的異種細胞數量。據點約每月補貨一次。</XTS_SettlementCountDesc>

  <!-- EN: Implantation -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSection>植入</XTS_ImplantationSection>
  <!-- EN: How xenogerms behave when implanted. -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>異種細胞植入後的行為方式。</XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Germline xenogerms replace germline genes -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>種系異種細胞取代種系基因</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>
  <!-- EN: Keep deathrest capacity -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>保留絕息容量</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, a person will keep the deathrest capacity gained from serums when a xenogerm is implanted, as long as they still have the deathrest gene. When disabled, their deathrest capacity will reset to one. -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>啟用時，只要此人仍擁有絕息基因，植入異種細胞後就會保留以血清增加的絕息容量。停用時，其絕息容量會重設為一。</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, a xenogerm for a germline xenotype will replace the person's germline genes, and their children will inherit them. Their existing xenogenes will be kept. When disabled, the genes will be implanted as xenogenes and will overwrite the existing ones. -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>啟用時，種系異種人的異種細胞會取代此人的種系基因，其後代也會遺傳這些基因。此人原有的異種基因會保留。停用時，這些基因會以異種基因植入，並覆蓋原有的異種基因。</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>

  <!-- EN: Xenotype rarity by price -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySection>依價格決定的異種人稀有度</XTS_CommonalitySection>
  <!-- EN: How the price of a xenogerm changes the chance that a trader will stock it. -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>異種細胞的價格如何影響商人販售它的機率。</XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePrice>反比</XTS_StrategyInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms will be much more common. Archite xenogerms will stay rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>較便宜的異種細胞會常見許多，遠古分子異種細胞依然稀有。</XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse root -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>反平方根</XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms will be somewhat more common. -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>較便宜的異種細胞會稍微常見一些。</XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Linear -->
  <XTS_StrategyPrice>線性</XTS_StrategyPrice>
  <!-- EN: More expensive xenogerms will be much more common. -->
  <XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>較昂貴的異種細胞會常見許多。</XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Square root -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>平方根</XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>
  <!-- EN: More expensive xenogerms will be somewhat more common. -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>較昂貴的異種細胞會稍微常見一些。</XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Bell curve -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurve>鐘形曲線</XTS_StrategyBellCurve>
  <!-- EN: Xenogerms near the median price will be the most common. The cheapest and the most expensive will both be rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>價格接近中位數的異種細胞最為常見，最便宜與最昂貴的都很稀有。</XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>
  <!-- EN: Uniform -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniform>均等</XTS_StrategyUniform>
  <!-- EN: Every sellable xenotype is equally likely, regardless of price. -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>無論價格為何，每個可販售異種人的機率均等。</XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>

  <!-- EN:  (default) -->
  <XTS_DefaultSuffix> (預設)</XTS_DefaultSuffix>

</LanguageData>
